report?postId\u003d5@1:CAEQrcz1_gkiGwoZQ0hfZE4tMkdVbElCSV9fY2dtNGQxUlk1dw%7CCAEQrcz1_gkiMAoZQ0hfZE4tMkdVbElCSV9fY2dtNGQxUlk1dxoTQ2d3SXp1NnYwd1lRcUtySnV3SQ\u0026t\u003d7\u0026wv\u003d1\u0026d\u003d286732320",null,null,"0ahUKEwjF-5_GyNKWAxUlj68BHfwDL7sQ_2MIygEoAQ"],"https://business.google.com/local/business/10559407455466063253/customers/reviews/reply?p\u003dCkRDaTlEUVVsUlFVTnZaRU5vZEhsalJqbHZUMnBzVUZadE5IaGhWRTU2VkVocmQxZEdWbkpoVjFWMFVsTXhNMUpYWXhBQhAA",[null,null,null,"/local/business/10559407455466063253/customers/reviews/reply?p\u003dCkRDaTlEUVVsUlFVTnZaRU5vZEhsalJqbHZUMnBzVUZadE5IaGhWRTU2VkVocmQxZEdWbkpoVjFWMFVsTXhNMUpYWXhBQhAA"],"https://business.google.com/local/business/10559407455466063253/customers/reviews/deletereply?p\u003dCkRDaTlEUVVsUlFVTnZaRU5vZEhsalJqbHZUMnBzVUZadE5IaGhWRTU2VkVocmQxZEdWbkpoVjFWMFVsTXhNMUpYWXhBQhAA",[null,null,null,"/local/business/10559407455466063253/customers/reviews/deletereply?p\u003dCkRDaTlEUVVsUlFVTnZaRU5vZEhsalJqbHZUMnBzVUZadE5IaGhWRTU2VkVocmQxZEdWbkpoVjFWMFVsTXhNMUpYWXhBQhAA"],null,"https://business.google.com/local/business/10559407455466063253/customers/reviews/reply?p\u003dCkRDaTlEUVVsUlFVTnZaRU5vZEhsalJqbHZUMnBzVUZadE5IaGhWRTU2VkVocmQxZEdWbkpoVjFWMFVsTXhNMUpYWXhBQhAA",[null,null,null,"/local/business/10559407455466063253/customers/reviews/reply?p\u003dCkRDaTlEUVVsUlFVTnZaRU5vZEhsalJqbHZUMnBzVUZadE5IaGhWRTU2VkVocmQxZEdWbkpoVjFWMFVsTXhNMUpYWXhBQhAA"],null,["zh-Hant"],[["親愛的顧客您好：\n謝謝您提醒建議，為了讓每位顧客都能依照排隊順序公平點餐與選取餐點，門店會請現場顧客依動線及排隊順序進行點餐、取餐及夾取餐點，以維持現場秩序與動線順暢。現場亦有設置排隊動線及相關告示，若造成您當日等候上的感受不佳，我們深感抱歉，也會持續檢視門店動線與服務方式，提供更好的用餐體驗。\n再次感謝您的建議，若您仍有其他意見想與我們分享，歡迎致電客服專線 0800-000-063，或來信至 service@toridoll.com.tw，將由專人為您服務。造成不便，敬請見諒，祝您順心愉快。",null,[0,148]]]],[null,null,146,["https://www.google.com/maps/reviews/data\u003d!4m8!14m7!1m6!2m5!1sCi9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT2psUFZtNHhhVE56VEhrd1dGVnJhV1V0UlMxM1JXYxAB!2m1!1s0x0:0x5038420e2b294506!3m1!1s2@1:CAIQACodChtycF9oOjlPVm4xaTNzTHkwWFVraWUtRS13RWc%7C%7C?hl\u003dzh-TW"],["https://www.google.com/local/con